        "step_number": 2,
        "text": "Step 2: Given that \\(17 \\cdot 5 = 85\\), we can see that \\(85 \\equiv 2 \\pmod{83}\\) because \\(85 - 83 = 2\\). Therefore, \\(17 \\cdot 5 \\equiv 2 \\pmod{83}\\)."
