        "prefix_token_count": 220,
        "step_number": 3,
        "text": "Step 3: To get from \\(17 \\cdot 5 \\equiv 2 \\pmod{83}\\) to \\(17 \\cdot x \\equiv 1 \\pmod{83}\\), we can multiply both sides of the congruence by the modular inverse of 2 modulo 83. The modular inverse of 2 modulo 83 is a number \\(y\\) such that \\(2y \\equiv 1 \\pmod{83}\\)."
      },
      {
        "aligned_char_end": 895,
