        "step_number": 5,
        "text": "Step 5: Now, we multiply both sides of \\(17 \\cdot 5 \\equiv 2 \\pmod{83}\\) by 42: \\(17 \\cdot 5 \\cdot 42 \\equiv 2 \\cdot 42 \\pmod{83}\\). Simplifying the right side, we get \\(17 \\cdot 210 \\equiv 84 \\pmod{83}\\). Since \\(84 \\equiv 1 \\pmod{83}\\), we have \\(17 \\cdot 210 \\equiv 1 \\pmod{83}\\)."
      },
